	column 'Column 2' = ```
			
			Var 
			Max_Hour =
			CALCULATE(MAX(fact_sales_order[ORDER_HOUR]),FILTER(ALL(fact_sales_order),fact_sales_order[ORDER_PLACED_TIMESTAMP]))
			
			RETURN 
			IF(fact_sales_order[ORDER_PLACED_TIMESTAMP] <= Max_Hour,1,0)
			```
